{"nodes": [{"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab", "label": "Phone Tool Tab Screenshot (Workbench Round 4)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Phone-width screenshot of the OpenLab 3D chemistry lab showing the equipment and reagent drawer open over the 3D scene. It documents how the tool tab fits a narrow mobile viewport in workbench round 4."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_equipment_substances_drawer", "label": "Equipment & Substances Drawer (\u0411\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0436 \u0431\u0430 \u0431\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0441)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A side drawer with a yellow header. Its subtitle reads '\u0414\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0445\u0430\u0434 \u0431\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442 \u0431\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0439\u0433 \u0433\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0430\u0430 \u0430\u0432\u043d\u0430 \u00b7 Tab / Esc: \u0445\u0430\u0430\u0445': tapping an item puts the real tool in the player's hand, Tab or Esc closes the drawer, and a Tab key badge shows the shortcut. On a phone it covers most of the screen."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_chemquest_back_pill", "label": "ChemQuest Back Button Pill", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A dark pill-shaped header with a purple circular back chevron and the ChemQuest brand name. It returns the player from the lab to the main app."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_equipment_substance_tabs", "label": "Equipment (43) / Substances (50) Tabs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A segmented control that switches the catalog between equipment (\u0411\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0436, 43 items) and substances (\u0411\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0441, 50 items). Each tab shows its item count."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_category_filter_chips", "label": "Category Filter Chips", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A row of filter chips that scrolls sideways: \u0411\u04af\u0433\u0434 (All, selected), \u0428\u0438\u043b\u044d\u043d \u0441\u0430\u0432 (Glassware), \u0425\u044d\u043c\u0436\u0438\u043b\u0442 (Measurement), \u0425\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0430\u0445 (Heating), and more cut off at the edge."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_catalog_search", "label": "Catalog Search by Name or Formula", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A search field with the placeholder '\u041d\u044d\u0440, \u0442\u043e\u043c\u044a\u0451\u043e\u0433\u043e\u043e\u0440 \u0445\u0430\u0439\u0445' (search by name or formula). Players can find reagents by their chemical formula as well as their Mongolian name."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_needed_for_experiment_section", "label": "Needed For This Experiment Section", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The '\u042d\u043d\u044d \u0442\u0443\u0440\u0448\u0438\u043b\u0442\u0430\u0434 \u0445\u044d\u0440\u044d\u0433\u0442\u044d\u0439' section pins the items the current experiment needs above the '\u0411\u0443\u0441\u0430\u0434 \u0431\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0441 \u0431\u0430 \u0431\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0436' (other substances and equipment) section, so students find the required materials first."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_item_card", "label": "Equipment/Reagent Item Card", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cards in a two-column grid. Each shows a 3D-rendered thumbnail, the name with a green check and '\u0448\u0438\u0440\u044d\u044d\u043d\u0434' (on the bench) status, a short description, and a pin marking where the item is stored."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_storage_location_indicator", "label": "Storage Location Indicator (Cabinet/Drawer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A pin icon followed by the item's location in the lab, such as '\u0428\u04af\u04af\u0433\u044d\u044d: \u0422\u0423\u0421\u0413\u0410\u0419 \u0423\u0420...' (cabinet: special reagents), '\u0428\u04af\u04af\u0433\u044d\u044d: \u0414\u0410\u0412\u0421\u041d\u042b \u0423\u0423...' (cabinet: salt solutions) or '\u0428\u0443\u0440\u0433\u0443\u0443\u043b\u0433\u0430: \u0425\u044d\u043c\u0436\u0438\u0445...' (drawer: measuring tools). It links the catalog to physical storage in the 3D room."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_graduated_cylinder_100ml", "label": "Graduated Cylinder (100 mL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_hydrogen_peroxide_3pct", "label": "Hydrogen Peroxide 3% (H2O2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The card names the catalysts as '\u041a\u0430\u0442\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u043d (KI, M...', most likely KI or MnO2."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_dish_soap", "label": "Dish Soap (\u0423\u0433\u0430\u0430\u043b\u0433\u044b\u043d \u0448\u0438\u043d\u0433\u044d\u043d)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The description begins '\u0425\u0438\u0439 \u044f\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0445 \u04af\u0435\u0434 \u0445\u04e9\u04e9\u0441...' (forms foam when gas is released), so the soap traps the evolved gas as foam."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_potassium_iodide_0_5m", "label": "Potassium Iodide 0.5 M (KI)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_elephant_toothpaste_reaction", "label": "Catalytic H2O2 Decomposition (Elephant Toothpaste)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inferred, not stated: the required items (H2O2 3%, KI catalyst, dish soap, graduated cylinder) match the classic KI-catalyzed decomposition of hydrogen peroxide into oxygen foam."}, {"id": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_collapsed_drawer_toggle", "label": "Drawer Edge Toggle Tab", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A yellow semicircular tab with a chevron on the left edge of the screen. It opens and closes the drawer by touch, the phone equivalent of the Tab key."}], "edges": [{"source": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab", "target": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_equipment_substances_drawer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab", "target": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_chemquest_back_pill", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab", "target": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_collapsed_drawer_toggle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_equipment_substances_drawer", "target": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_equipment_substance_tabs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openlab-3d/docs/workbench-round4/phone-tooltab.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phone_tooltab_equipment_substances_drawer", "target": "openlab_3d_docs_workbench_round4_phon